## ✅ Quick Checklist — Before Uploading Document

### Specific Mode Document ✔️
- [ ] Company name (spoken Hindi form)
- [ ] Founded year (spoken form)
- [ ] Website (spoken form)
- [ ] Project name + abbreviation
- [ ] Problem statement with real ₹ figures (Crores in Devanagari)
- [ ] Before/after impact metrics (% in Devanagari)
- [ ] Government recognition / award
- [ ] Minimum 5 specific data points (Crores in Devanagari)
- [ ] 5+ objection handling Q&A

### Consultative Mode Document ✔️
- [ ] Company name, year, website (spoken Hindi)
- [ ] 4-5 broad solution categories listed
- [ ] Department-to-solution mapping (minimum 5 departments)
- [ ] Per-solution: how it works + result metric
- [ ] Company credentials & government clients
- [ ] Company-level objection handling Q&A

---

## ⚠️ Common Mistakes — इनसे बचें

> [!WARNING]
> **Numbers English में मत लिखें।** Document में अगर "₹14,000 lakh" लिखा है तो AI confuse हो सकता है।
> सही format: "वन हंड्रेड फ़ॉर्टी करोड़ रुपये"

> [!CAUTION]
> **Urdu/Arabic script document में बिल्कुल न हो।** AI को strict Devanagari mandate है।

> [!NOTE]
> **Specific mode में company का single project document upload करें।** दो अलग projects का एक ही document न डालें — AI confuse हो जाएगा।

> [!TIP]
> **Data points जितने specific होंगे उतना बेहतर।** "काफी savings हुई" की बजाय "वन हंड्रेड फ़ॉर्टी करोड़ रुपये के suspicious payments block हुए" लिखें।
